  "<svg:g id=""cla-annotations""><svg:g id=""tour-unit-0""><svg:rect x=""121"" y=""140"" width=""1218"" height=""300"" class=""stage-band"" rx=""8""/><svg:text x=""133"" y=""162"" class=""stage-label"">unit 0  ·  nibble A  ·  orbit AA55  ·  G0P0→C1</svg:text><svg:animate attributeName=""opacity"" values=""1;0.14;0.14;0.14;0.14"" keyTimes=""0.0000;0.2500;0.5000;0.7500;1.0000"" dur=""8s"" calcMode=""discrete"" repeatCount=""indefinite""/></svg:g><svg:g id=""tour-unit-1""><svg:rect x=""121"" y=""450"" width=""1218"" height=""280"" class=""stage-band"" rx=""8""/><svg:text x=""133"" y=""472"" class=""stage-label"">unit 1  ·  nibble A  ·  orbit 718E  ·  G1P1→C2</svg:text><svg:animate attributeName=""opacity"" values=""0.14;1;0.14;0.14;0.14"" keyTimes=""0.0000;0.2500;0.5000;0.7500;1.0000"" dur=""8s"" calcMode=""discrete"" repeatCount=""indefinite""/></svg:g><svg:g id=""tour-unit-2""><svg:rect x=""121"" y=""750"" width=""1218"" height=""300"" class=""stage-band"" rx=""8""/><svg:text x=""133"" y=""772"" class=""stage-label"">unit 2  ·  nibble 5  ·  orbit EE11  ·  G2P2→C3</svg:text><svg:animate attributeName=""opacity"" values=""0.14;0.14;1;0.14;0.14"" keyTimes=""0.0000;0.2500;0.5000;0.7500;1.0000"" dur=""8s"" calcMode=""discrete"" repeatCount=""indefinite""/></svg:g><svg:g id=""tour-unit-3""><svg:rect x=""121"" y=""1100"" width=""1218"" height=""420"" class=""stage-band"" rx=""8""/><svg:text x=""133"" y=""1122"" class=""stage-label"">unit 3  ·  nibble 5  ·  orbit CA35  ·  G3P3→C4</svg:text><svg:animate attributeName=""opacity"" values=""0.14;0.14;0.14;1;1"" keyTimes=""0.0000;0.2500;0.5000;0.7500;1.0000"" dur=""8s"" calcMode=""discrete"" repeatCount=""indefinite""/></svg:g><svg:g id=""tour-index"" transform=""translate(980, 130)""><svg:text x=""0"" y=""0"" class=""legend-title"">I-222 orbit  K(·,1D1D)</svg:text><svg:text x=""0"" y=""22"" class=""tour-idx"">Δ^0  AA55  →  unit 0<svg:animate attributeName=""opacity"" values=""1;0.12;0.12;0.12;0.12"" keyTimes=""0.0000;0.2500;0.5000;0.7500;1.0000"" dur=""8s"" calcMode=""discrete"" repeatCount=""indefinite""/></svg:text><svg:text x=""0"" y=""42"" class=""tour-idx"">Δ^1  718E  →  unit 1<svg:animate attributeName=""opacity"" values=""0.12;1;0.12;0.12;0.12"" keyTimes=""0.0000;0.2500;0.5000;0.7500;1.0000"" dur=""8s"" calcMode=""discrete"" repeatCount=""indefinite""/></svg:text><svg:text x=""0"" y=""62"" class=""tour-idx"">Δ^2  EE11  →  unit 2<svg:animate attributeName=""opacity"" values=""0.12;0.12;1;0.12;0.12"" keyTimes=""0.0000;0.2500;0.5000;0.7500;1.0000"" dur=""8s"" calcMode=""discrete"" repeatCount=""indefinite""/></svg:text><svg:text x=""0"" y=""82"" class=""tour-idx"">Δ^3  CA35  →  unit 3<svg:animate attributeName=""opacity"" values=""0.12;0.12;0.12;1;1"" keyTimes=""0.0000;0.2500;0.5000;0.7500;1.0000"" dur=""8s"" calcMode=""discrete"" repeatCount=""indefinite""/></svg:text></svg:g></svg:g><svg:g id=""cla-equations"" transform=""translate(140, 1535)""><svg:rect x=""0"" y=""0"" width=""1180"" height=""195"" rx=""6"" fill=""#f4f6f8"" stroke=""#ccc"" stroke-width=""1""/><svg:text x=""14"" y=""18"" class=""legend-title"">octal dialectic 16-pairs → 65536</svg:text><svg:text x=""14"" y=""38"" class=""octal"">Aᵢ Bᵢ  (aₕ,aₗ)(bₕ,bₗ)  octal digits of the limb</svg:text><svg:text x=""14"" y=""56"" class=""octal"">Gᵢ=Aᵢ·Bᵢ   Pᵢ=Aᵢ⊕Bᵢ   Cᵢ Sᵢ close the pair</svg:text><svg:text x=""14"" y=""74"" class=""octal"">x ∈ 0…65535  one contiguous 16-bit address</svg:text><svg:text x=""14"" y=""92"" class=""octal"">pair spans 8×8=64; full space 65536 addresses</svg:text><svg:text x=""14"" y=""110"" class=""octal"">shape of 1/998001: linear index → structured runs</svg:text><svg:text x=""14"" y=""132"" class=""eq"">CLA: Cᵢ₊₁=Gᵢ+Pᵢ·Cᵢ   Sᵢ=Pᵢ⊕Cᵢ</svg:text><svg:text x=""14"" y=""152"" class=""eq"">look-ahead expands C on the G/P vector</svg:text><svg:text x=""14"" y=""172"" class=""eq"">n width = how many 16-pairs fit the word</svg:text><svg:text x=""400"" y=""18"" class=""legend-title"">I-222 proof roll-up</svg:text><svg:text x=""400"" y=""38"" class=""proof"">boot mark: sector ends 55 AA → word 0xAA55</svg:text><svg:text x=""400"" y=""56"" class=""proof"">AA XOR 55 = FF;  AA XNOR 55 = 00  (NULL)</svg:text><svg:text x=""400"" y=""74"" class=""proof"">word turned XNOR = 00 00  (NULL NULL)</svg:text><svg:text x=""400"" y=""92"" class=""proof"">still points of L: 0000 3333 5555 6666</svg:text><svg:text x=""400"" y=""110"" class=""proof"">               9999 AAAA CCCC FFFF</svg:text><svg:text x=""400"" y=""128"" class=""proof"">even-parity nibbles repeated (8 still words)</svg:text><svg:text x=""400"" y=""146"" class=""proof"">square(FF)=5555 — a still point (carry-less)</svg:text><svg:text x=""400"" y=""168"" class=""proof"">AA55 orbit under 1D1D: AA55→718E→EE11→CA35</svg:text><svg:text x=""780"" y=""18"" class=""legend-title"">adder path · kernel</svg:text><svg:text x=""780"" y=""38"" class=""proof"">AA55 nibbles [A,A,5,5] sum 30</svg:text><svg:text x=""780"" y=""56"" class=""proof"">YHWH [10,5,6,5] sum 26  (share 10,5)</svg:text><svg:text x=""780"" y=""74"" class=""kernel"">L(p)=rotl1⊕rotl3⊕rotl14  (linear part)</svg:text><svg:text x=""780"" y=""92"" class=""kernel"">K(p,C)=L(p)⊕C   delta = K(·, const)</svg:text><svg:text x=""780"" y=""110"" class=""kernel"">const 0x1D1D → AA55 period 4</svg:text><svg:text x=""780"" y=""128"" class=""kernel"">const 0x1D   → every word period 8</svg:text><svg:text x=""780"" y=""146"" class=""kernel"">tour lights unit s on orbit word s</svg:text><svg:text x=""780"" y=""168"" class=""kernel"">deterministic replay; mask keeps width</svg:text></svg:g><svg:g id=""cla-legend"" transform=""translate(140, 118)""><svg:text x=""0"" y=""0"" class=""sig-g"">G generate</svg:text><svg:text x=""110"" y=""0"" class=""sig-p"">P propagate</svg:text><svg:text x=""230"" y=""0"" class=""sig-c"">C carry</svg:text><svg:text x=""330"" y=""0"" class=""sig-s"">S sum</svg:text><svg:text x=""420"" y=""0"" class=""sig-ab"">A/B data</svg:text></svg:g></svg:g><svg:text x=""140"" y=""1755"" class=""small"">I-222: variables as octal dialectic 16-pairs on 65536; tour follows AA55 orbit under K(·,1D1D) (period 4); each step lights one unit/nibble of the A A 5 5 path; still points of L and NULL NULL squared</svg:text></svg>"
  .
